AD_MEDIA_AUDIO: Required to access the audio files stored on your device and use them as custom sound effects in the game\n- android.permission.READ_MEDIA_VIDEO: Required to access the video files stored on your device and use them as custom video clips in the game\n- android.permission.READ_MEDIA_IMAGES: Required to access the image files stored on your device and use them as custom textures in the game\n- android.permission.ACCESS_MEDIA_LOCATION: Required to access the location metadata of the media files and use them to generate realistic lighting and shadows in the game\n- android.permission.READ_MEDIA_IMAGE: Required to access the image files stored on your device and use them as custom stickers in the game\n- android.permission.READ_MEDIA_VISUAL_USER_SELECTED: Required to access the media files selected by the user and use them as custom items in the game", "created_date": 1703744543, "id": "7519422661401047", "version": "0.4", "version_code": 4, "release_status": "PENDING", "status": "CHANGES_REQUESTED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": {"id": "7519420681401245"}, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "7355515404458441", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "7612527752090537"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "1329444384608835"}]}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1703601526, "id": "7513609191982394", "version": "0.3", "version_code": 3, "release_status": "PENDING", "status": "DRAFT", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application":